<title>POLAND: Poland raises Sept T-bill offer to PLN 3.15 bln.</title>
<headline>Poland raises Sept T-bill offer to PLN 3.15 bln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish finance ministry raised its monthly T-bill offer for September to 3.15 billion zlotys from 2.6 billion in August.</p>
<p>The ministry will not offer 39-week paper in September and will offer only 100 million zloty worth of its shortest 8-week bills at one auction on September 23.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
